    "regime_notes": "Full-history validation uses the 15 tradable benchmark instruments and Spearman cross-sectional IC with at least 8 valid instruments per date. Recent 365/750/1260-day ICs were 0.019414/0.031308/0.028130; corresponding ICIRs were 0.056721/0.097011/0.088911. Recent one-year stability is below the admission ICIR threshold, so monitor for drift despite full-sample admission.",
